Tile 5.1a: PostgreSQL not reporting

Run this on its own first.

timeseries up = avg(postgres.uptime), by:{device.name, device}, from:-24h, interval:5m
| fieldsAdd reportingNow = arraySize(arrayRemoveNulls(arraySlice(up, from:-3))) > 0
| filter reportingNow == false
| fieldsAdd hostShort = lower(splitString(device.name, ".")[0])
| lookup [
    fetch dt.entity.host
    | fields hostName = entity.name, tags
    | expand t = tags
    | filter startsWith(t, "APMID:")
    | fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(t, "APMID:")[1],
                hostShort = lower(splitString(hostName, ".")[0])
    | filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
    | summarize claimsApps = collectDistinct(apmid), by:{hostShort}
  ], sourceField: hostShort, lookupField: hostShort, prefix: "h."
| filter isNotNull(h.claimsApps)
| fieldsAdd technology = "PostgreSQL",
            status     = "🔴 Not reporting",
            apps       = arrayToString(h.claimsApps, delimiter:", ")
| fields status, technology, server = device.name, database = device, apps
| sort server asc


Expected result: probably no records, which is the healthy state. To confirm the query works, temporarily delete the filter reportingNow == false line. You should then see about 145 rows, matching the H1 result.

Tile 5.1b: MSSQL databases not ONLINE
timeseries st = max(`sql-server.databases.state`, scalar: true),
           by:{device.name, database, database.state}, from:-15m
| filter isNotNull(st) and database.state != "ONLINE"
| fieldsAdd hostShort = lower(splitString(device.name, ".")[0])
| lookup [
    fetch dt.entity.host
    | fields hostName = entity.name, tags
    | expand t = tags
    | filter startsWith(t, "APMID:")
    | fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(t, "APMID:")[1],
                hostShort = lower(splitString(hostName, ".")[0])
    | filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
    | summarize claimsApps = collectDistinct(apmid), by:{hostShort}
  ], sourceField: hostShort, lookupField: hostShort, prefix: "h."
| filter isNotNull(h.claimsApps)
| fieldsAdd technology = "MSSQL",
            status = if(database.state == "RESTORING" or database.state == "RECOVERING",
                        concat("🟠 ", database.state), else: concat("🔴 ", database.state)),
            apps = arrayToString(h.claimsApps, delimiter:", ")
| fields status, technology, server = device.name, database, apps
| sort status asc, server asc


